<title>UK: UK approves ICI buy of BASF unit.</title>
<headline>UK approves ICI buy of BASF unit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Department of Trade and Industry said on Thursday it would not refer Imperial Chemical Industries Plc's proposed acquisition of BASF AG's synthesis gas catalyst unit to the Monopolies and Mergers Commission.</p>
<p>ICI said in late January it would buy the BASF unit, which has annual turnover of about 15 million stg. ICI said the value of the transaction represented less than one percent of its group net assets.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
